ithub.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/110615","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110615","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110615.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110615.patch","merged_at":"2026-06-19T17:12:23Z"},"body":"Closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/6688\r\nCloses https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/12554\r\n\r\n| VHS Circle | OKHSL Circle |\r\n|---|---|\r\n| <img src=https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/164c7030-a20a-4094-a762-5dcab464cc13 height=300> | <img src=https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5655156d-6217-47e8-957b-8c0a60a12b65 height=300> |\r\n\r\nRationale: Showing a full white circle by default is suprising. It's tedious having to repeatedly explain to newbies that this isn't a bug, why it's all white, and how to change the shape / default shape.\r\n\r\nShowing an HSV circle is more appropriate than an HSL circle since users can edit the color below in RGB or HSV format, whereas they cannot edit the L value.\r\n\r\nFYI: the default shape was changed from VHS circle to OKHSL circle in 4.0 (#59786)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/us